WEBVTT

00:00:00.138 --> 00:00:02.523
For most of human history,
the treatment was words.

00:00:02.523 --> 00:00:04.673
Someone who knew the
right ones said them over

00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:06.122
you. That was not
superstition.

00:00:06.122 --> 00:00:07.431
It was the state of the art,

00:00:07.431 --> 00:00:09.581
and the Chinese state
funded it for a thousand

00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:09.862
years.

00:00:10.149 --> 00:00:12.185
The physicians of high
antiquity, I have heard,

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:14.394
cured a man by shifting his
essence and speaking to

00:00:14.394 --> 00:00:16.126
the cause. One sentence
and it was done.

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:18.032
Mine use poisons inside
and needles outside,

00:00:18.032 --> 00:00:19.851
and it works about half the
time. Explain.

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:22.244
Nobody will tell you the
old invocations were

00:00:22.244 --> 00:00:23.204
stronger than a needle.

00:00:23.204 --> 00:00:24.624
What changed was not the
medicine.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:26.796
In the old age there was no
burden of longing within

00:00:26.796 --> 00:00:28.341
and no striving after office
without,

00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:29.636
and sickness never got in
deep.

00:00:30.232 --> 00:00:32.555
Now worry winds around a
man from the inside and

00:00:32.555 --> 00:00:34.685
hard labour wears him
down from the outside.

00:00:34.685 --> 00:00:36.815
The illness reaches the
marrow and the bone.

00:00:36.815 --> 00:00:38.026
And so, the chapter says,

00:00:38.026 --> 00:00:39.769
the invocation can no
longer end it.

00:00:40.231 --> 00:00:41.303
I audit things for a living,

00:00:41.303 --> 00:00:43.027
and this chapter is a
ladder of ages each one

00:00:43.027 --> 00:00:43.793
worse than the last,

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:45.555
which is the most common
complaint anybody has

00:00:45.555 --> 00:00:46.513
ever made about anything.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.275
But then it gives itself
away in the very last

00:00:48.275 --> 00:00:49.770
passage, and I did not see
that coming.

00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:51.771
Shut the door and close
the window.

00:00:51.771 --> 00:00:53.895
Stay with the patient and
ask again and again what

00:00:53.895 --> 00:00:54.278
is wrong,

00:00:54.278 --> 00:00:55.850
and follow wherever the
answer leads.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.974
That is what the chapter
puts where the spell was,

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.716
and it is worth asking
whether it is one.

00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:02.708
A dramatized adaptation of
a classical philosophical

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:03.914
text. Not medical advice.

00:01:03.914 --> 00:01:06.230
The full episode asks what
actually replaced the

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:06.761
invocation,

00:01:06.761 --> 00:01:09.077
and whether the profession
ever entirely stopped

00:01:09.077 --> 00:01:09.801
performing one.
